日市區氣溫20度至25度，相對濕度60%至85%，東至東北風4級，部份時間有陽光。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:36:29.138083+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":4133,"images":39,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T05:13:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T05:50:13.068897+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T05:30:00.343600+00:00","content_hash":"bc1865240ae9f2bbe3bf468a11de44e889ce5289494178ce004e9a55022bde14","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}